  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Display One Card\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Use the arrays you generated in the previous level.\r\n\r\n2. Create variables that store the values at index 0 from each array.\r\n\r\n3. Use those variables to call `createCard()`.\r\n\r\n4. Run your code and check:\r\n   * Does one card display correctly?\r\n   * Do all parts of the card match?\r\n\r\n### Reminder:\r\n- Index 0 represents one complete card\r\n- All values at the same index should match",
    "submittable": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
